      "id": 1,
      "text": "Logan was first called “Islands of the Guyandot” by 1780 explorers before becoming Lawnsville in 1827.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2",
